      "FIX_7 (Tool Gen): Added 'meta_tool_generator_model' and 'meta_tool_critique_model'.",
      "FIX_12 (PI Detect): Added 'prompt_injection_model'.",
      "FIX_1 (Tool Caching): 'enable_tool_caching' flag added to caching_config.",
      "FIX_8 (Metrics): 'metrics_log_path' added to logging_config.",
      "FIX_13 (Semantic Validation): 'enable_semantic_validation' flag added to agent_stacks."
